-  ![dirD u 1 z - dirichletGraphSlope f z * dirD u Complex.I z,
-    -dirichletGraphSlope f z * dirD u 1 z +
-      (1 + dirichletGraphSlope f z ^ 2) * dirD u Complex.I z] i
