-      ((‖physicalDrivenCentered γ θ‖ * ‖physicalDrivenQ E‖) ^ ℓ / (ℓ.factorial : ℝ)) ≤
-    (2 * M * ‖physicalDrivenQ E‖ ^ j) *
-      ((R * ‖physicalDrivenQ E‖) ^ ℓ / (ℓ.factorial : ℝ))
