-      0 < r ∧ r < δ ∧ r < 1 ∧ Continuous G ∧ LipschitzWith KB β ∧
-      Function.Periodic β (2 * Real.pi) ∧ InjOn β (Ico 0 (2 * Real.pi)) ∧
